# a pattern that matches fewer labels
-- old.cue --
m: [string]: int
-- new.cue --
m: [=~"^a"]: int
-- out --
incompatible
m accepts any field name in the prior schema and only names matching [=~"^a"] in the new one; prior instances with a field here whose name does not match are rejected (rule labels-narrowed) @ new.cue:1:1
